###Block: Descriptions
Detect Weaponry.MOD	DESC:Reveals weapons within 60 feet.
False Peacebond.MOD	DESC:As peacebond, but subject can draw the weapon freely
Impeding Stones.MOD	DESC:Earthen ground and cobblestones crack and shift, hampering foes. Targets must make a Reflex save (each round) or be knocked prone. Success allows movement at half-speed. Forces Concentration checks.
Peacebond.MOD	DESC:Weapon is impossible to draw.
Secret Weapon.MOD	DESC:Makes a hidden weapon almost impossible to detect (+20 or +10 to Sleight of Hand check based on size).
Spacious Carriage.MOD	DESC:Summons a carriage and horses to pull it.
Summon Pest Swarm.MOD	DESC:Summons swarm of urban animals and vermin.
Zone of Peacebond.MOD	DESC:As peacebond, but affects all weapons in area.
Cocoon of Refuse.MOD	DESC:Subject is entangled by trash and detritus in the area.
Devil's Whispers.MOD	DESC:As suggestion, plus the subject believes his actions were his own idea.
Thieves' Bane.MOD	DESC:As hold portal, plus the portal explodes for 5d6 damage (Reflex save for half) when forced open.
